In the event of arrest, the applicant- Vindhyachal Singh, involved in the aforesaid case crime, be released on anticipatory bail during pendency of trial, on furnishing a Vindhyachal Singh vs State Of U.P. on 13 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/34362446/
3 personal bond of Rs. 50,000/- with two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of the court concerned with the following conditions:-
(i) The applicant shall make himself available on each and every date fixed in the matter by the court concerned;
(ii) The applicant shall not directly or indirectly, make any inducement, threat or promise to any person acquainted with the facts of the case so as to dissuade from disclosing such facts to the Court;

